# Per-plugin lockfiles are ignored (each plugin can build standalone), but the
# fixtures *workspace* lock must be tracked: it is what makes
# `cargo metadata --offline` and plugin builds reproducible from a clean
# checkout. The negation has to come after the pattern it re-includes.
fixtures/plugins/**/Cargo.lock
!fixtures/plugins/Cargo.lock
